    },
    {
      "id": "077df50169f882abdc866a52dc9e50bbf9f5ba30fe2b0c90e4bf98538ac7dd1a",
      "text": "AI Coding Dictionary",
      "hash": "4def77f9388809f53620144510fcc4b6f08662617bcc06a15abc618242e6544c"
    },
    {
      "id": "9d57264473a819017ef558dbe9ff7628b9d28e832c40b1589d296ee59b30aecb",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "d220dd3c62038d46463647cc916276e25ea4fe4c391ec739245a575b06920c68",
      "text": "Patterns of Work",
      "hash": "451912cbee5f0ec6ab7874916ee61c5d7d98c7c960493b524130e6c14b3e3f92"
    },
    {
      "id": "a10dbb0564ee9db0afc4834f67b254cd45ab1c470314bbe79876f84fc685830a",
      "text": "Human review",
      "hash": "c1f43b8fad7537eba5cc87664a03cf3efedf7b64fb1d45ffa16a81d566ea2cb3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3d3e4395a9014459ea2f1bc24919ee8cd86132a1b01b48b9c327cc8b95fe6c6",
      "text": "The user reading the code the agent produced and forming a judgement on it. Reading the diff counts; reading the summary doesn't.",
      "hash": "33f76b077094cf9c62f314ff6410e57501b60bf963422de95a099811431db1e1"
    },
    {
      "id": "5efb2da18964a8cb133b922ffecb6c6681f8d40260a71b43dadee213ba6aca81",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "23102f1206f3e3a31bb47da18737f5cf0dbe6a756beab473193962348f0f228e",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2f550591c9fbb5d17a378f237e0bd441c7312a426c4641a3d109954bd4648e6",
      "text": "The user reading the code the",
      "hash": "bd6e613bd9aa5ebf3c2df6b9af7566c785385c0a75c72d9b5720fe819f405e22"
    },
    {
      "id": "d09ed8af510b9e8fae2f84e8b4e73d00457a5038d2bfc381507a43688e5f07a8",
      "text": "produced and forming a judgement on it. Reading the diff or the changed files counts; reading the agent's",
      "hash": "f43b3d46bea4398efd37e7dc8c5cf5217e5ca3af31484d1ca5070a5c8d769ef1"
    },
    {
      "id": "9df004733988b455f14aaeff6614969776fa9554db677a7650ee683a90e0b4bf",
      "text": "of what it did does not — narration is not the artifact. The description is a",
      "hash": "cf8abe506e3bab5baa7cb1c60bef3d0e7f3b5f4ec2f94b216b00d6f7834ef974"
    },
    {
      "id": "05c1df7dd23c6da03944d13a43f0727fd9466c5e81fe8bee42493cf5b60ad220",
      "text": "secondary source",
      "hash": "130ab3f910dec4f94436851c6b9a50abec9e6cb96e7aadf7c47be2e57da1c894"
    },
    {
      "id": "fef1ddb5fc613928d15bd7f26e30e98fd493e655abb0ed450e0c75539d17a870",
      "text": ", written by the party being reviewed; the diff is the",
      "hash": "58a5828f3df4bb05bc379d3340176bfc98974889146293a106945f53c5607b2f"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6310b9484f634388d3b40f8db73500fab1988447c6cabbd384d027ea0e790a2",
      "text": "primary source",
      "hash": "4c3f03bb625194b79deeff56ee12d13258ff531de6eef1fff5529d0fe89a1404"
    },
    {
      "id": "99b788a19217f37dfe17e132e75b313aa0e89f05f4d2175223e69a2e174753d8",
      "text": ", and review means reading it.",
      "hash": "e74683c2695277d25d71002fdd1a040d66f7ae0e2e0b0e5343611605df2eb83a"
    },
    {
      "id": "1245e612508830d663913dbb68cb5dfc339c7af86c1f07730c6233c7c91925ab",
      "text": "Agents raise the volume of code produced, so review becomes the bottleneck. One useful idea is layering different review strategies.",
      "hash": "18480b70cfb43e4316f20682e1005845215466062c54aa8063002fbad11b84ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "70596c875a939bcdd9ac7ec4b5e07db67f6603317050a350a6719f26fd68d6b6",
      "text": "Automated checks",
      "hash": "ad388fff8307156c06378e27c636406888b9e933e6d9896949ea27a045f49e60"
    },
    {
      "id": "8371511c2b80a60e6316aa6471b1c50a77d9885ea02fb70518cb060406ae0159",
      "text": "catch the mechanical failures,",
      "hash": "1cc8458f281ae037baf11cbd5b0ea3dfed42bb0d86ef9509dd03995b5c3a74a9"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6072c918d6b1df642b83c2863f6947e15c9100662fbd396f58a8e4cb8880e54",
      "text": "automated review",
      "hash": "50f191cd5fc38204b448aef31fe4355cd06753a9cd829931d5b71343757317d6"
    },
    {
      "id": "51d523318ca029abbb97dd8eb230a1047f605c4e6877f348d511833ea2fda5b9",
      "text": "catches the describable ones, and human review is reserved for what only you can judge — whether the change is the right change, whether the approach fits the codebase, whether this should exist at all.",
      "hash": "e1bf238f8e2535d07e2cd91848b319b2607c57506b60117579dd509e9cbe3f2b"
    },
    {
      "id": "79c64d991672ac59bef2598b0f2c85674802f9274f85786891e9be60c9a8016d",
      "text": "Review is also cheaper earlier. Reading a plan before work starts, or a small diff mid-flight, takes minutes; excavating a finished branch after an",
      "hash": "1189e9545f6cd8e1d971011df9d79272e61e09acc26aa51c5c30bef73d682e9b"
    },
    {
      "id": "80ba0548daa069800f1d85a89e3807bfc5a980a646c0030e3cc21cfb210ea86a",
      "text": "AFK",
      "hash": "875e0577157f743e3346ba95f1d944d08e54b3cab40d89819dff5f48cd507392"
    },
    {
      "id": "dac28178b1167f037f747f6b6222b3e242932944e297256372c95595d9f5973b",
      "text": "run takes longer. Where you place the review checkpoint is a",
      "hash": "84b5bd92c784d01ac2df4b506f083295fb21ab1f27dbb5af2463602e0ed2b0d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "ada9a8bdb6a61717ec0a4912b601d1e0e3e9a17716c2cfc092273ceb8f2ac99d",
      "text": "decision, not an afterthought.",
      "hash": "f209bc74671b8da058e3b5f3494d1c2459175b67af8cab54ef3ba36687a3fbf2"
    },
    {
      "id": "9f9a16519d0f9b967bf7f96990abacbb921c221c09be4f95dc7e69e621e8ff04",
      "text": "Avoid:",
      "hash": "0c98d3dd1920fdb71269240ba1ce3a7323099760ecd0b295f071aca6b07e30df"
    },
    {
      "id": "fa30fe3cc2e4cda19e22c2115f2eb29228339058c5438fdda630b53c6674543c",
      "text": "\"code review\" alone — ambiguous between human and automated.",
      "hash": "72d11163e105411666f00f17bd7453f0ef54a1f1cdbb805a7a2934330c013797"
    },
    {
      "id": "47a4e43624564dd3f74a82ad2104c73946ed84e5bdfb34e2acd514630208b597",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "f0b19e07dbf5eb01cb04a515553156d56d58229e54a2c7dccffd4e06686b3527",
      "text": "\"I human-reviewed the AFK output.\"",
      "hash": "132028c1d8ee96a12fef5833f7a77a081a23367a773447790ed658150efa58e0"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2b309b81bed1f0190c6d79466c4fe4287fcf02563f45c1d0c7885d6b0daeb74",
      "text": "\"You read the diff or just the summary?\"",
      "hash": "19a58e60ee8b831190fb4aac70e566d9568e06b263720b289be7333509adeec8"
    },
    {
      "id": "9a999aaae7b7ce97430870655c5e49c5c2f1eb91500488d275171cfd2a7d3d4c",
      "text": "\"Diff. The summary said it deleted dead code — turned out the function was called from a generated file.\"",
      "hash": "a595d15cd070ae3e6fe82908cce8837fa482be1349e7507b3d5b73ee7a73934e"
    },
    {
      "id": "95621ff3d040ab599b8139e00c9b9dbbc9f6344f4bc8fb63a428e3da6b9e4cc5",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ebaf1e7daa9e51afd40aca145506c45dfc4c25276b30a2a50212ff75f2d6d952",
      "text": "Automated review",
      "hash": "df3514233adbdec46b793e0c605f72423cd52386b0c05dcd3d604d6f196da301"
    },
    {
      "id": "eb51163faa7823cc59bb2f102d6698c3f925b8408f4a2519642fb7838eb58c31",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "3cce43342a9d015ac82d6b0abedc948c7a75a77c958f7abf9747c0f841d69bc5",
      "text": "Vibe coding",
      "hash": "043de4d164bd53f633b0d486ea898fddf3e3c3ca941f408349eeab6185ee8892"
    },
    {
      "id": "63ebda4aa11b6de94265581eb989c634d86cba90990381e9931e8e8738b4e8ea",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
    {
